        "cooked": "<p>(i was poking around and didn't see it discussed elsewhere so posting this here but apologies if there is already a thread on this that i missed).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So I was reading the comic and a couple random observations...</p><p>p12. panel 3: love the little reference happening in the background there</p><p>p12. panel 4: is dr stinson really saying 'wife' ? or is that an error and the speech bubble for that should go to legacy?&nbsp; (not that there is anything wrong with that, just wondering if it's an aspect of her life that i had not caught on to before)</p><p>p13. panel 1: it so appropriate to have the 'awesome' inspirational poster in her office :D</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>anyone else have random things they noticed that made them chuckle/etc?</p>",
