        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Ironic\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/48/2171_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ironic:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I am depressed every time I get reminded that Bunker is canonically white, since I am incapable of readng his dalogue wthout&nbsp;imagining the voice of Khary Payton (mostly, as Cyborg from Teen Titans, but rarely Young Justice Aqualad&nbsp;in&nbsp;introspective moments).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I will admit that (when first showed the game and not knowing anyone's backstories) in my mental image of Bunker without his suit he was of a different race &amp; ethnicity…So, yeah, seeing him without his suit took me by surprise too.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>PS. By the way, kudos for mentioning Young Justice  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1.png?v=12\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">  easily one of my favorite shows on TV these days.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
