        "created_at": "2013-01-11T22:36:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love the contrasting actions and reactions of the three heroes, leaving home and getting Legacy's exposition. &nbsp;Especially the part where Bunker is talking tactics, Tachyon is talking about how awesome her toys are, and Wraith is preparing for other battle later (and possibly solo). &nbsp;I'm really looking forward to seeing more of Wraith, too, to help get a better view of how she differs from Batman.</p>",
