        "created_at": "2013-01-16T01:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"boxwood\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/eb8c5e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> boxwood:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>They's jets flying similar to some of the posters Barney Stinson has in his office on \"How I met your Mother\", Tachyon is pretty much one big giant reference to the works of Neal Patrick Harris. &nbsp;Some of her cards flavor text references HIMYM and Dr. Horrible mainly.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I KNEW I had seen that poster somewhere before! As if I didn't love Tachyon enough already.</p>\n<p>I also like that the poor guy on Fanatic's Final Dive is once again in peril on page 12.</p>",
